==Strategy==
The main threats of this stage are extremely powerful [[Single Attack]] attackers, so the best strategy to deal with it is to bring a lot of cheap meatshields, and have a few [[:Category:Nuker-class Cats|nukers]] to destroy the enemies before they stack up. The B.B.Bunnies should provide enough money to keep up your meatshield spam. Using meatshields that cost 75 is very cost efficient as they get one shot by the extremely powerful single target enemies anyway, while the Eraser variants cost double and also get killed in one hit.

For 4♛, use [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Jiangshi]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]], and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen]], along with research combos, which turns this stage into just a spamfest.

