==Trivia==
*Drunken Backrub's Japanese name, Drunk Massager, directly refers to [[Cala Maria]] - her Japanese description calls her attack 肩たたき ''katatataki'', meaning a shoulder massage performed by ''[[wikipedia:tapotement|tapotement]]'' (a massage technique involving rapid and repeated striking of the body).
*Prior to [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]], the stage had a width of 4,000 rather than 5,500 and there were no [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]].

